description:
One Pilobolus PR (one deploy): pin the newest `@anthusai/papyrus` develop prerelease (docs/releasing.md), set invocationName 'pilobolus newsroom', and nothing else. Then check:
- the skill sync runs in the build;
- a direct Lambda test passes;
- Ryan tries it on the Show.

Never two Pilobolus deploys back to back.
